+**Interfaces:**
+- Consumes:
+  - CLI args: `--threshold exact_match=0.9 --threshold toxicity=0.8`
+  - Commander.js option parsing (already used in codebase)
+  - `Eval.generateReport` function (from Task 1)
+- Produces:
